s configuration for each car:</strong> All vehicles have different settings which makes them suitable for different races or driving styles.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>30 Achievements:</strong> A full achievement system to award stunts and special skills and also to teach some of the techniques in the game. <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Leaderboard:</strong> A worldwide leaderboard for each racetrack.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Car damage:</strong> cars get damaged which does not influence the handling.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Random atmospheres:</strong> From sunshiny, to fogy the same racetrack may have a very different feel in two races.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
